{"t":"Rift Warrior Outfits Quest","s":"rift-warrior-outfits-quest-bc3b9","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Male_Addon_3_654dab.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rift Warrior Outfits Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(250 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.90<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Dungeons of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Ruthless%20Seven%20Minions\">The Ruthless Seven Minions</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurers%27%20Guild\">Adventurer's Guild</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellflayer\">Hellflayers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vexclaw\">Vexclaws</a>, the seven newest members of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Ruthless%20Seven%20Minions\">The Ruthless Seven Minions</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rift%20Warrior%20Outfits\">Rift Warrior Outfits</a> and addons:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Male_Addon_3_654dab.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Female_Addon_3_74d040.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rift%20Warrior\">Rift Warrior</a> achievement.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfit\">Base Outfit</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Male_bb8a4e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Female_32190a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Complete the <a href=\"#/quest/ferumbras-ascension-quest\">Ferumbras' Ascension Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_1\">Addon 1</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Male_Addon_1_73835f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Female_Addon_1_5281d0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Bring 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Cledwyn\">Cledwyn</a> and ask for this addon.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_2\">Addon 2</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Male_Addon_2_a01294.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Rift Warrior Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Rift_Warrior_Female_Addon_2_b09d89.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Bring 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Cledwyn\">Cledwyn</a> and ask for this addon.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward_2\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Besides the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rift%20Warrior%20Outfits\">Rift Warrior Outfits</a> you will also earn the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rift%20Warrior\">Rift Warrior</a> achievement after completing this quest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_1_2\">Addon 1</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Blessings, <i>Player</i>! How may I be of service? Do you wish to trade some {token}s, or would you like some {information} or {talk}?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>silver</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Here's the deal, <i>Player</i>. For 100 of your silver tokens, I can offer you some first-class torso armor. These armors provide a solid boost to your main attack skill, as well as ...<br/>\nCledwyn: some elemental protection of your choice! So, which skill type are you most interested in: {sword}, {axe}, {club}, {distance} or {magic level}? ...<br/>\nCledwyn: Additionally I sell both {addons} for the Rift Outfit.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>addons</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Ah, very good. Now choose your addon: {first} or {second}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>first</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Ah, excellent. Obtain the first addon for your rift warrior outfit.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rift Warrior Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_2_2\">Addon 2</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Blessings, <i>Player</i>! How may I be of service? Do you wish to trade some {token}s, or would you like some {information} or {talk}?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>silver</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Here's the deal, <i>Player</i>. For 100 of your silver tokens, I can offer you some first-class torso armor. These armors provide a solid boost to your main attack skill, as well as ...<br/>\nCledwyn: some elemental protection of your choice! So, which skill type are you most interested in: {sword}, {axe}, {club}, {distance} or {magic level}? ...<br/>\nCledwyn: Additionally I sell both {addons} for the Rift Outfit.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>addons</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Ah, very good. Now choose your addon: {first} or {second}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>second</b><br/>\nCledwyn: Ah, excellent. Obtain the second addon for your rift warrior outfit.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rift Warrior Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["ferumbras-ascension-quest"]}